+ ## Usage
+ # Review a skill package or directory
+ skillscan review /path/to/skill --format markdown
+ # Scan multiple skills and save results
+ skillscan review /path/to/skills --output-dir /tmp/skillscan-out
+ # Use external engine (requires skill-scanner CLI installed)
+ skillscan review /path/to/skill --engine external --format markdown
+ ## Output
+ - Input type detection
+ - Engine execution status
+ - Security findings with risk levels
+ - Recommendations
+ ## Enterprise Integration
+ skillscan review /path/to/skills   --output-dir /tmp/skillscan-out   --upload-url https://scanner.example.com/api/report   --instance-id prod-a1
